      "releaseNotes": "New: a field of faint stars behind the Mission Briefing.\nNew: your rings now show in orange so they're harder to miss.\nImproved: the schedule looks a week ahead — today, tomorrow, and any day after that with something on it.\nImproved: drag the crawl with a finger to move through it, or keep using the crown.\nFixed: SYSTEMS buttons respond across the whole row, not just on the text.\nFixed: the date is easier to tap.\nFixed: radio callouts no longer cut each other off, and never repeat the same line twice in a row.\nFixed: an appointment ending at midnight no longer appears on the following day too.",
